# --- Datasets (1.8 GB of COCO alone) -------------------------------------
data/
RyzenAI-SW/

# --- Nested Ignition checkout --------------------------------------------
# A clone of the Ignition app repo lives at ./Ignition so one workspace can
# develop both: the engine here and the user-facing app there. It is its own
# git repository with its own remotes, never part of this one.
/Ignition/

# --- Model artifacts -----------------------------------------------------
# Regenerate with the export/quantize steps, or pull from the companion
# Hugging Face model repo. Too large and too reproducible to version here.
models/
*.onnx
*.pt
*.xmodel

