# Gemini's own per-repo instruction file and state dir, the counterparts of
# CLAUDE.md / .claude/. Added 2026-09-09: this repo documents an `agy`
# (Antigravity/Gemini CLI) workflow and carries a `gemini-review` branch, so a
# GEMINI.md is a realistic near-miss, and the policy is to extend this block
# BEFORE such a file is ever staged rather than to catch it at commit time.
.gemini/
GEMINI.md
# Qwen Code's per-repo instruction file and state dir, the counterparts of
# CLAUDE.md / .claude/. QWEN.md was covered from the start; `.qwen/` was added
# 2026-09-17 after it turned up untracked, under the same pre-empt-not-catch
# policy as the Gemini entry above.
QWEN.md
.qwen/
model.onnx
# Quark drops this in the cwd on every quantization run
quantized_info.csv
# Antigravity CLI / agents
.agy/
.agents/
