# aider's per-repo state (.aider.conf.yml, chat/input history, tag cache) and a
# local MCP client config dir. Added 2026-09-10 after both turned up untracked
# in one machine's checkout; aider had appended `.aider*` to that working copy's
# .gitignore without it ever being committed, so every other checkout was exposed.
.aider*
.ai/
# Session handoff/scratch notes, whichever assistant wrote them, a local
# plugin scaffold, and a personal claude+agy orchestration script with its
# scratch worktrees/logs -- see CLAUDE.md's "AI tooling stays private" policy.
HANDOFF_*.md
claude-handoff.md
claude-handoff.*.md
*handoff*.md
/TODO.md
dev-tools/
.worktrees/

# --- Run outputs ---------------------------------------------------------
# COCO detection dumps are 2-3 MB each and are regenerated by 5_eval_map.py.
# The *.log files in results/ are small and ARE tracked deliberately.
results/dets_*.json
scratch/
# The TUI (tui/, scripts/tui.sh) writes every result it produces here, never into
# results/ -- that tree is the tracked evidence base and 69 of its images are cited
# from the docs. Sidecar JSONs here record a hostname, so this stays local.
outputs/

